     "body": "<p>To do this we might need to provide two versions of activemq.xml with <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-configs/src/main/resources/config/activemq.xml#L134\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this line</a> either commented out (disabled) or uncommented (enabled). Then provide a [jetty.xml](<a href=\"https://github.com/apache/activemq/blob/main/assembly/src/release/conf/jetty.xml\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/apache/activemq/blob/main/assembly/src/release/conf/jetty.xml</a>). I’m assuming we just set it up fairly simply with http access and simple basic authentication. Anything more complex and you’d need to provide your own activemq.xml </p>",
